# ROVEXO Canonical Switch Engine v1.0 (LOCKED)

**STATUS: UI LOCK | APPROVED | ONE PLATFORM = ONE SWITCH**

## Golden rule

Every switch in ROVEXO must use **Canonical Switch Engine v1.0**.

- Component: `CanonicalSwitch` (`src/components/canonical/CanonicalSwitch.tsx`)
- Alias: `SettingToggle` → `CanonicalSwitch` only
- Engine: `@/lib/master-engine` → `resolveCanonicalSwitchChecked` / `getSwitchEngineSnapshot`
- CSS: `.cds-switch` tokens in `styles/rovexo/canonical-ds.css`

## Spec (immutable)

- Visual: **28×16** · Thumb **14** · Radius **50%**
- Hit target: **44×44** (visual remains 28×16)
- OFF: `#E5E7EB` · ON: `#047857` · Thumb: `#FFFFFF`
- Animation: **200ms** ease-in-out · no glow / bounce / gradients
- Disabled: **40%** opacity · not clickable
- Fail-closed: unavailable → **OFF only**

## Forbidden

- Parallel switch sizes (32px, 24px, etc.)
- Blue / purple / red / custom switch colours
- Custom switch components, CSS tracks, or animations
- `role="switch"` outside `CanonicalSwitch.tsx`

## Mandatory surfaces

Profile Holiday Mode · Settings Notifications / Privacy / Security · Notification controls · future Wallet / Promotions / Business / Admin / Super Admin toggles.

## Production

`activateProductionRules()` remains inactive unless Owner activates. Local / QA / Demo / Visual / E2E show the locked switch everywhere.
